00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.470
Sometimes it's a little embarrassing to watch as their daughter, though.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.170
Really?

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.480
I think it's a good thing, though!

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.210
About your father being an elementary school teacher...

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:34.210
Does he live separately for work convenience?

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:34.880
Yeah.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.750
Originally he worked at the elementary school in this town, though.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:42.560
My mother was worried about father being alone, so she went with him.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.350
Oh? They really are lovey-dovey, aren't they?

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.470
So that's why you live with your sister.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:49.360
That's right.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.440
I didn't want to leave this town.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.750
That's because Rito's here, right?

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.200
Eh?

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.560
Ah, no-

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:58.930
Well... Yeah.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.200
I see.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:05.460
Haruna has loved Rito for a lot longer than I have.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.130
The same goes for Rito.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.800
Hmm... all right!

