00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:20.740
Ah. Hello, Rito?

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.640
Yeah.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:24.850
You know, Haruna's saying she wants you to come over to play!

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:27.040
Yeah, right now.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.240
We'll be waiting for you!

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.360
Bye-bye!

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.600
Now it's all okay!

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.340
L-Lala-san?

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:36.820
Haruna, you have to confess to Rito today for sure!

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:37.690
Eh!?

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:40.570
T-That's i-impossible!

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.290
If confessing is impossible...

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.700
Why don't you try kissing him suddenly?

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.850
Sairenji...

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.260
Yuuki-kun...

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:52.710
Kiss!?

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.890
W-What are you saying!?

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:56.720
I'm saying it's okay if it's you, Haruna!

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.220
You don't need to worry about me.

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.140
I'll just work on a half-finished mecha or something!

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.850
B-But...!

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.530
<i>Just do it the way you want to.</i>

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:25.890
<i>If your heart can accept it, that is.</i>

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.930
It's no good.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:43.150
I can't stop thinking about what mother said.

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:48.550
I love Rito-san, and to that end, I conceived the harem plan.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:49.940
Ah!

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.830
Rito-san?

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:52.560
Momo?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.930
What is it?

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:56.150
Um...

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.480
An invitation from Haruna-san?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.170
Yeah.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.750
I was wondering if it's really okay to go.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.360
It sure sounds like it's big sister's work.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:12.010
Well, if they make progress this way, then it saves me the trouble{hardship}.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:13.290
I think it's okay.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:16.460
Haruna-san will surely be delighted.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.270
What are you making, Lala-san?

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.500
Um...

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.770
A mecha that will temporarily return my stature to its former size.

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:28.160
Your stature...?

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:33.090
I've regained most of my strength and I should return to my original size,

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.980
but I don't know exactly when that will happen.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.490
So I thought it might be handy to have a mecha that make my height grow when I'm in trouble.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:43.950
But making a mecha that has the desired effect is difficult.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.490
I wish you good fortune, Lala-sama.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:47.670
Ah!

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:55.210
Ah, hello.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.770
Hello.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.680
Ah. Sairenji, these are for you.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.970
Ah, thank you.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.230
Please, come in.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.970
Yes, thank you.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:07.990
As expected of you, Rito!

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.980
You're so thoughtful!

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:12.890
No, Momo told me to bring them.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.450
Is your sister working?

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:21.940
Yes, that's right.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.950
Ah! Rito, be careful!

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.820
One of my mechas is there!

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.950
Eh? W-Where?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.460
By your foot.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.830
Oh, no!

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:48.300
Huh?

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.100
They vanished?

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:51.880
Perhaps they warped?

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:55.060
I didn't include that kind of system, though.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:55.580
Huh?

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:56.230
Ah!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.320
L-Lala-sama! L-Look there!

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.540
S-Sorry. But, w-what happened?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:21.590
Lala!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.470
Why did you get so huge!?

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.790
The two of you shrank{ grew small}!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:31.470
I meant to make it cause growth but it looks like it turned out to be a shrinking mecha!

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.070
What the hell is that!?

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:35.100
It's the exact opposite effect!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.870
I'm sorry.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:39.660
You should return to normal in about an hour or so.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.430
An hour!?

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:45.020
What do we do about clothes!?

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.570
Well, for now...

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.980
Why did it turn out like this...?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.710
Someone's here.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.660
Haru-chan, it's your mum!

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.050
We were nearby so we came to play, Haruna!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.790
Ah! Haruna's Papa and Mama!

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.640
No way! At a time like this?

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.570
What'll we do...?

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:13.560
If they see me like this...

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:17.180
Huh? Maybe she went shopping or something. {6:19}

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.810
Let's go inside and wait her her to come home.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.940
Wait a sec... I'll get the key out.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:24.680
They're coming in!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.640
Hey, Lala, what are you going to do!?

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:30.330
Hmm... For now, I'll try disguising myself as Haruna...

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.550
That's impossible! There isn't enough time!

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:33.450
That's it!

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:37.500
Oh, my!

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:41.320
So you are here after all, Haru-chan!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:43.250
Welcome!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.340
Oh, that hair ornament is cute!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.400
Are you changing your image?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.970
Yeah, that's right!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.150
They haven't figured it out.

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.930
As expected of Peke!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:57.430
Let's make use of a costume and elevator boots, Lala-sama!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:01.190
Anyway, it's been a while, hasn't it? Papa, Mama?

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.130
What are you saying?

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.820
We had a meal together three days ago with Akiho, too.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.570
O-Oh, that's right!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.870
And what's with you calling us Papa and Mama?

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.100
Your dad's gonna get embarrassed!

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:14.420
I wonder if Lala-san will be okay...?

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:18.480
I can't believe I had a near-miss with Haruna-chan's parents this way...

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.360
What are they doing?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.300
T-That's-{r}

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:31.750
Your father and I had tea today at that café we've made so many memories at.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.230
That café really hasn't changed at all.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:38.080
Of course, Natsumi-san hasn't, either!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.730
Neither have you, Fuyuhiko-san!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.480
The two of you really do get along well.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.910
What are you saying after all this time, Haru-chan?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:50.470
Your parents are always lovey-dovey!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.920
I'm sorry my parents are like that...

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.060
Sorry about what?

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.410
I just feel that way.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.530
How about you, Haru-chan?

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.740
Do you have anyone you like?

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.090
Eh, me?

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.160
That's right!

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:06.920
Your mother and I had just started going out at about your age.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.050
We always went on dates whenever we had free days.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:13.500
Oh? So you went on lots of dates, huh.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.440
Lala-san, ignore that!

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.630
You don't need to get them to talk about that!

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.520
My parents are just being nostalgic about it!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:24.030
Well then, where did you two have your first kiss?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:25.520
She broke straight into it!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.440
Our little Haruna...

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.530
Has finally come to the age where she's
becoming interested in those kinds of things.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.600
That's right.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:43.450
Our first kiss was in a park at twilight after our first date!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.630
No! Stop talking about that!

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.130
D-Don't listen to this story, Yuuki-kun-{r}

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:57.930
Sairenji!

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:17.820
I-I didn't see anything!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.890
I didn't see anything, so it's okay!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.290
M-Me too!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.560
W-What do I do!?

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:27.420
I saw it so close, it's burned in my mind and I can't forget it!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:31.730
I saw e-everything... Calm down!

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.560
Have to think of something else... That's it!

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.740
I'll overwrite it with the Principal's face!

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:39.180
The Principal... Principal... huh?

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:43.680
Maron?

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:47.160
He won't... eat us, will he?

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:51.840
I don't think that will be a problem, but...

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:55.330
When he sees me, he gets excited and comes to lick me.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:59.450
I-If it comes to that at this size...

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.400
Oh no, he's awake.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.040
Let's hide in there!

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.660
Just now, I faintly caught master's scent.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.390
Did that Lala girl go home?

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.260
Because she came over to play,

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:30.900
I haven't had much skinship with master today.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:37.100
Oh, how I want to show her this burning loyalty of mine!

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.510
Where are you?

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:41.490
Where are you, master?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.740
Y-Yuuki-kun!

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:45.240
Stay still.

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:46.820
B-But...

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:58.550
Ah... it's so embarrassing...

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.090
It's okay.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.850
I'll protect you, Sairenji.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:11.730
Please... don't say any more cool things like that...

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.530
Oh, no.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.550
I-I'm sorry, Yuuki-kun, I was...

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.240
Maron...

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.270
It's strange...

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:38.330
I can smell master, but I can't see her.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.380
Why!?

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:44.830
Sairenji... now that it's come to this, I'll dash out and draw Maron's attention.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:47.570
During that opening, run in the opposite direction and hide!

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.300
That's no good!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.400
If you do that, it'll be dangerous for you, Yuuki-kun!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.460
But at this rate, we'll be found.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:55.270
There's no other choice!

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:58.780
I'll...!

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:06.220
Wow! You're so bold!

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:06.780
Right?!

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.650
Master's voice! That way!?

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:15.720
Oh, if it isn't Maron.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:20.200
You're as cute as ever. Here, come here.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.260
Oh... Something like that happened...?

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.340
So, did her parents find out in the end?

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:54.700
