<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:54.700
<b>「I think</b>

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:54.700
<b>「I think</b>

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:54.700
<b>~One step forward~」</b>

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:54.700
<b>~One step forward~」</b>

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:52.210
Nope!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.300
They were living it up.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:59.000
Those two were in a great mood!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:03.010
I saw them off along with Maron, they were holding hands!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:07.680
Rito-dono and Haruna-dono were able to return safely to their normal size, too.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.220
I wasn't sure how well it would go,

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.190
but it was okay in the end. Right, Rito?

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.470
Yeah, I guess it did.

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:17.650
If that's the case, then you should use that whenever you need it.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:20.780
I thought that too, but...

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:26.650
Unfortunately, the energy it consumes is far too high for daily use.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.610
Hey! Celine, come here!

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.840
Come on! You need to rinse off properly!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.060
Ah! Yes!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.940
The girl I've been in love with since middle school!

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.020
I finally...!

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.000
No...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:12.600
No matter how you look at it, that was an accident.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.620
What's more...

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.750
No, there's no way it's okay, is there?

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.630
In the first place, I'm not taking
Haruna-chan's feelings into consideration...

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.040
That's right...!

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.820
How does Haruna-chan feel about that kiss?

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:31.490
Now that I think about it, kissing a guy you don't even like is no-go, right?

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.550
That's right, this is bad!

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:37.020
There's even a chance that it'll make her hate me!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:42.270
Is there something you're worried about, Rito-san?

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.650
Momo?!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.290
When did you...!?

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:51.390
You let your guard down because I haven't come lately, didn't you?

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:55.180
It feels like your mind is preoccupied.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:58.070
Did something happen at Haruna-san's house?

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:00.210
Eh? No, nothing in particular.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.860
Oh my, is it a secret?

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.570
H-Hey...!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.350
No matter what?

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:17.070
W-Wait a minute...!

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:24.560
Are you sure you won't tell me?

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:30.860
Well, in that case, I won't force you to, so rest easy.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:35.800
It'll probably take Mikan-san about 30 minutes to get out of the bath,

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:40.290
so I'll make sure to give you lots of service until then.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.100
It's okay.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:44.210
You can do it any time if you fee like it.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.730
I'm not the same as I was before!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:59.020
O-Okay! I'll tell you! I'll tell you!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.840
Ah! What do I do, what do I do!?

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.800
So that's what a kiss is like...

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.940
It was so hot and soft...

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:29.170
I feel like my body's going to melt just remembering it!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.140
I wonder if I should tell Lala-san...

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.860
But... It was just an accident in the end, right?

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.960
I wonder what Yuuki-kun thought about it...

00:16:56.190 --> 00:17:00.520
Oh? Another new baby was born in the Digital Safari?

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:05.320
This time it was a nine-octopus, so there are lots of babies!

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:07.000
Ah! How wonderful!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.250
Show me later!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.870
It was a giga-boar before.

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:13.590
It looks like there's a baby boom in the Digital Safari, doesn't it!

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.380
Yeah!

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:16.750
It's strange, though...

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:20.820
Why do babies always appear when a couple gets together?

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:24.360
Eh? Could it be... that you don't know how it happens?

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.660
How what happens?

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:39.780
P... Put it in?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.220
So you didn't know, after all!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.760
Well, I skipped the royal palace lessons...

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:50.240
Unlike Momo, I didn't research it on the internet, either...

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:53.170
Why don't you try practising with Rito-senpai?

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.260
Making babies.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.570
You idiot!

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:58.760
Stop running!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.370
Kiss!?

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:05.020
Even though it was an accident, Rito-san and Haruna-san kissed?!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:10.050
That's right, this is something I should be happy about for the purpose of the Harem Plan.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:14.610
Because it will become a great asset in progressing Rito-san and Haruna-san's relationship.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:16.860
And yet... And yet...

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:20.280
Why do I feel like I somehow lost!?

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.560
Look. Momo-sama is absorbed in thought.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:26.470
As usual, she's lovely at all times! {18:26}

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.280
Listen to this.

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.990
Last night I had a crazy dream.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.420
Eh? What kind of dream?

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.620
Don't be surprised.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:39.250
I kissed a thousand girls!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.430
Seriously!? That's crazy!

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:45.230
Impressive, right? A thousand girls. A thousand.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:47.520
A thousand!? I don't believe it!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.440
Can't blame you, I can't either!

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.820
Huh? Where are you going, Rito?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.870
Ah, I'm going to the bathroom for a bit.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.040
Ah, he's going to the bathroom.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.770
Don't go to the bathroom!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.380
I was just getting to the good part!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:06.120
C-Could it be... he hates me?

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:10.160
What am I doing?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.960
Now it looks like I ran away!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.960
Rito-kun!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:15.850
Run?

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.100
Listen, listen!

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:20.400
So I was recording earlier and something interesting happened!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:21.890
Hey, Run-san!

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:23.990
You're clinging onto a boy too much!

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.260
What's your problem?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.330
You always appear out of nowhere, Kotegawa-san.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:28.420
Jealousy?

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:30.020
It's for the public morals committee!

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:34.440
What should I do...

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:38.390
But that's my relationship with Rito-kun.

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.780
You're not in that kind of relationship!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.600
Please calm down, you two.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.640
If you get angry, your beauty goes to waste!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:48.210
Isn't that right, Rito-san?

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.040
U-Uh, yeah.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.690
Beauty? Rito-kun!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:54.830
W-What are you saying!

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.440
Ah, Rito-san.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:59.270
Honekawa-sensei is calling for you over there.

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:00.840
Eh, is that so?

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.120
T-That's right.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:08.360
I'll mediate everyone's relationships and polish the Harem Plan!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.640
That is what I must do!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:15.560
Rito-san.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:19.650
Yay!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.660
What do I do?

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:24.360
Should I talk to Lala-san about it?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.910
What's the matter, Haruna-san?

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.120
Oshizu-chan.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:33.620
I-I can talk about it if it's with Oshizu-chan, right?

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.130
Eh!?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.040
K-Kiss!?

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.790
You mean <i>that</i> kiss, right!?

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.980
Your voice is too loud, Oshizu-chan!

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.410
That's amazing!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.980
At last you've gone that far!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.560
Y-Yeah.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.270
But, um... it was an accident.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:56.400
And... I don't know what to say to Yuuki-kun.

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:00.440
I kind of feel like he's avoiding me.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.240
It's obvious what you need to do!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.160
Confess!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.160
Confess!

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.590
What did you... just say?

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:17.710
Confess to Haruna-san and convey your feelings, Rito-san.

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.340
You won't get many chances like this!

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.300
B-But to confess like that, it's like I'm just going along with it...

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:33.520
Y-You've loved her since middle school, haven't you?

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:40.630
You'll always love Haruna-san from now, won't you, Rito-san?

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:45.700
If that's the case, it can't stay this way forever, can it?

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:49.510
I'll help you. So...

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:56.770
Convey your feelings to him, Haruna-san!

00:21:56.770 --> 00:22:01.000
M-My feelings...?

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.770
Sorry for asking you to come suddenly.

00:22:09.770 --> 00:22:14.640
I-It's okay, I also wanted to talk to you, so...

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:26.400
Should I really convey my feelings?

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.010
Do I have the right?

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:32.910
Me, who constantly struggles with so much confusion?

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:36.800
What is it that you feel for Lala-chan?

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:39.540
Don't do anything that would make a girl cry.

00:22:40.030 --> 00:22:43.800
Let's make it... a harem for you, Rito-san.

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:50.440
N-No... At the very least, my feelings haven't changed.

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:52.840
Ever since middle school.

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:59.940
It shouldn't be too late to make clear how I feel to Lala and Run after I convey my feelings to Haruna-chan.

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:04.470
Go on and say it, me!

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:06.440
<i>Yuuki-kun, I...</i>

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:09.610
<i>I... I lo-</i>

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:12.990
<i>Sairenji, I...</i>

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:17.450
<i>I love...</i>

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:19.580
<i>I love...</i>

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:26.640
I lo-

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:27.170
I'm sorry!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:40.140
Eh?

00:23:40.510 --> 00:23:43.150
About yesterday!

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:45.750
Yesterday?

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:47.000
I'm sorry!

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:47.650
Are you angry?

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:51.070
No, no, no, I'm not worried about that.

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:55.670
I mean, I'm always doing things that would make people angry, so...

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:58.510
T-That's not true.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:06.180
I was supposed to confess, but I ended up apologising...

00:24:06.180 --> 00:24:09.300
I'm glad to hear Yuuki-kun wasn't angry, though.

00:24:09.740 --> 00:24:11.690
I'm sorry, Oshizu-chan!

00:24:11.690 --> 00:24:14.300
I'm so sorry for being a coward!

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:18.700
Haruna-san... give it your best next time.

00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:27.720
Oshizu-chan!

00:24:27.720 --> 00:24:28.820
That octopus...!

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:32.420
I-I'm sorry!

00:24:32.420 --> 00:24:37.880
I was trying to show the nine-octopus to Mea, but he wouldn't listen to me!

00:24:49.620 --> 00:24:52.220
Ah, my body is-

00:25:01.290 --> 00:25:02.530
Yuki-kun!

00:25:06.300 --> 00:25:09.360
So in the end, it turned into something like this...

00:25:09.360 --> 00:25:13.490
I should leave before I get pulled into this...

00:25:16.080 --> 00:25:20.500
Why am I feeling a little relieved...?

00:25:30.010 --> 00:25:31.000
Ah.
